# Worker service

Background job processor for order events. It consumes the `orders` BullMQ queue on Redis (`REDIS_URL`; see `.env.example` at the repo root).

## Commands (run from the repo root)

- `pnpm --filter @acme/worker dev` - start with hot reload; needs Redis (`docker compose up -d redis`)
- `pnpm --filter @acme/worker test` - unit tests (Vitest); they must pass before you finish

## Conventions

- Handlers must be idempotent: after a crash BullMQ may deliver a job twice, so check `processedEvents` before any side effect.
- Add a new handler in `src/handlers/`, then register it in `src/index.ts`.

## Ask first

- Before changing retry or backoff settings in `src/queue.ts`: on-call alerting is tuned to them.
